`{{id}}` is written directly into the URL text rather than via a `path-table` row — `toolparams`' `binds` only matches a literal `{{token}}` somewhere in the request, and a `path-table` row's plain key (paired with the URL's single-brace `{id}` convention) doesn't count as one. Found by actually running `tool verify` against an earlier version of this file that used `path-table` — see `local-testing/mcp-testing-checklist.md`.

