This section's own request/assertion is perfectly correct on its own — the point is that it never gets the chance to prove that. Its `toolverifies` lists an `auth-check` row (pointing at "Admin Auth Check" above) **before** its `happy-path` row; per the spec, an `auth-check` failure gates and skips every dependent row, tagging the tool as an auth failure rather than evaluating (and passing) the happy-path proof underneath.

